Package: libnostr1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nostr protocol implementation for C (headless ABI)
 libnostr is a C implementation of the Nostr protocol: event/tag encoding,
 signing/verification (secp256k1), transport (libwebsockets) and helper types.
 .
 This package ships the shared library libnostr.so.1 built with the
 GLib-free (headless) ABI (NOSTR_WITH_GLIB=OFF, decision D-14) so servers
 can install the nostr login stack with no GLib/GTK/GNOME dependency.

