 Development files for libnostr: headers under /usr/include/nostr/ and
 the nostr.pc pkg-config metadata for the GLib-free (headless) ABI.

Package: libnostrgo0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Go-inspired concurrency primitives for C
 libnostrgo provides Go-inspired concurrency primitives (channels,
 wait groups, tickers, contexts, refcounts, error propagation) used by
 libnostr and the nostrc runtime.
 .
 The library was renamed from `libgo` (which collides with gccgo's
 runtime in Debian) as decision D-3; the on-disk soname is
 libnostrgo.so.0.

